<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The Company's business activities falls within a single segment (Engineering) in terms of Accounting Standards - 17 of ICAI.  n  n2. The Company's operations and financial results for the six months ended 30th September, 2020 have been adversly impacted by the outbreak of covid-19 pandemic and consequent lockdown annunced by Govt. of India due to which the operations were suspended for part of the first quarter and gradually resumed with requisite precautions. The results for the six months are, therefore, not comparable with those for previous six months. The Company has considered the possible effects that may results from COVID-19 in the preparation of these interim financial results for the quarter and nine months ended 31st December, 2020. While assessing the carrying value of its assets and liabilities, the company has considered internal and external information avaliable, and based on such information and assessment, have concluded that no further adjustments are required to be made to thses results. The impact of the pandemic mat differ from that estimated as at the date of approval of these interim financial results. The Company will continue to closely monitor any material changes to future economic conditions.  n  n3. Given the nature of business of the company and product mix in the respective quarter the results of any quarter may not be a true and/or proportionate reflaction of the annual performance of the company. Further quarter to quarter results are alo affected by the type of the products manufactured / sold during that quarter.  n  n4. The above financial results have been approved by the audit committee &amp; Board of Directors at their meeting held on 13th Feb, 2021. The Statutory Auditors have carried out a limited review of the results for the quarter ended 31st December, 2020 and have issued unmodified report on these results.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
